      "margin_number": 177,
      "speaker": null,
      "text": "Note the -α- dominated δύναμαι, ‘I am able, can’. The stem is δυνα-. Instead of taking the thematic vowel and being a contract verb, it is athematic: the endings are simply added to the stem. You should learn this verb now as you will meet other verbs that conjugate in the same way (such as ἀνίσταμαι, ‘I get up, emigrate’: 187):",
      "lang": "en",
      "para_no": 177,
      "marker": null,
      "table": null,
